
# Assignment 3.5 — Blog / Portfolio Mini-Project

## 1. Objective

To create a personal portfolio website using HTML. The website includes a header, navigation bar, About Me section, skills, projects, images, useful links, and a footer with contact details. Semantic HTML elements are used to improve structure and accessibility.

## 2. Project Folder Structure

Create a folder named `portfolio-project` with the following structure:

portfolio-project/
│
├── index.html
├── about.html
├── projects.html
└── images/
    ├── profile.jpg
    ├── project1.jpg
    └── project2.jpg

Add your own images to the `images` folder using the filenames shown above.

