4. Create a folder named `images`.
5. Add three images named `profile.jpg`, `project1.jpg`, and `project2.jpg`.
6. Copy the appropriate HTML code into each file.
7. Replace the sample email address with your own email address.
8. Save all files.
9. Open `index.html` in a browser or use the Live Server extension.
10. Click the navigation links and verify that the pages and sections open correctly.
11. Check that all images load properly.

Important: The image filenames in the HTML code must match the actual filenames in the `images` folder. Replace the sample text and images with your own information before submission.

