## 9. Upload the Project to GitHub

Open the terminal in the `portfolio-project` folder and run the following commands:

```bash
git init
git add .
git commit -m "Create personal portfolio website"
git branch -M main
git remote add origin https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/portfolio-project.git
git push -u origin main
```

Replace `YOUR-USERNAME` with your GitHub username. Create an empty repository named `portfolio-project` on GitHub before running the remote and push commands.

After uploading, copy the URL of your repository for submission.

